  "body_html": "<h1>binarySocialWelfare_update</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\nlemma binarySocialWelfare_update (b : I → U) (i : I) (θ : U) (x : BinaryAllocation I) : binarySocialWelfare (Function.update b i θ) x = θ * binaryToAllocation x i + Finset.sum (Finset.univ.erase i) (fun j =&gt; b j * binaryToAllocation x j)</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>BinaryAllocation</li>\n<li>binarySocialWelfare</li>\n<li>binaryToAllocation</li>\n</ul>",
